        "text": "When people hear that I spend my evenings watching bats, they often ask whether I've always been interested in wildlife. Well, I enjoyed going to the park as a child, but I wasn't particularly interested in animals. It was a broken streetlight that first got me interested in bats. One evening, on my way home, I stopped beneath it and noticed these tiny shapes flying around in the darkness. A neighbour told me what they were, and I started reading about them."
